  <div class="wrap page-head">
    <h1 class="display h1">English websites and buyer outreach for Chinese factories</h1>
    <p class="lede">If you’re an export manager at a Chinese factory, our sister company in Chengdu, <span lang="zh-CN">成都寰桥</span>, reviews your English website, rebuilds it for overseas buyers, and runs English outreach to companies that fit your products. It bills in RMB and issues fapiao.</p>
    <p class="ctas"><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Contact</a>{ZH_LIVE && <a class="zh-link" href={HOST.zh + '/audit/'} hreflang="zh-CN">Chinese version for your boss →</a>}</p>
  </div>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap doc">
      <h2 class="display h2 sec-title">How it works</h2>
      <ol class="list">
        {steps.map((s) => <li><strong>{s.name}.</strong> {s.body}</li>)}
      </ol>
      <p>A first-order bonus can be agreed in writing for target companies that both sides have registered.</p>

      <h2 class="h3">What your factory does</h2>
      <p>You send product details, photos, specifications, certificates, price ranges, minimum order quantities and lead times within 14 days. You quote within two working days of an inquiry. The owner or export manager joins the kickoff and the monthly review. If materials or quotes are late, outreach pauses and the service period is extended, so paid months are not used up.</p>

      <h2 class="h3">What we don’t do</h2>
      <p>We never handle goods or payments, and we are not an import-export agent. Your factory quotes, sends samples, signs sales contracts, collects payment, exports and handles after-sales. We don’t promise inquiries or orders. Those depend on your product, price, certificates, the market, and how fast you follow up.</p>

      <h2 class="h3">Who it’s for</h2>
      <p>Manufacturers in Sichuan and Chongqing first, with stable products, the ability to quote and send samples, and the certificates their market requires. We don’t take food, supplements, medical products, cosmetics, children’s products, batteries, chemicals, or products sold only on price.</p>
      <p>For email, quote and document systems for forwarders and trading companies, see <a href="/china/">our page for companies in China</a>.</p>

      <h2 class="h3">Company</h2>
      <p>Registered as <span lang="zh-CN">{HQ.name}</span>, Unified Social Credit Code {HQ.uscc}. The company issues fapiao.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
